# Privacy Policy for Bat Flap

**Effective Date: October 13, 2026**

Thank you for playing Bat Flap.

Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how information may be collected and used when you use the Bat Flap mobile application.

## 1. Information We Collect

Bat Flap does not require you to create an account, and we do not ask you for information such as your name, email address, phone number or postal address.

Bat Flap uses third-party advertising services, including Google AdMob. These services may automatically collect certain information from your device in order to provide advertisements, measure their performance, prevent fraud, and maintain the advertising service.

Depending on your device, settings, location, and consent choices, this information may include:

* IP address
* Device and advertising identifiers
* General device information
* App interactions, such as app launches, taps, and ad interactions
* Diagnostic and performance information
* Approximate location derived from information such as your IP address

We do not directly receive information that identifies you personally from Google AdMob.

The game's music and sounds are included with the app. Bat Flap does not use your device's microphone, camera, contacts or location services.

## 2. Information Stored on Your Device

Bat Flap keeps a record of your play so that your progress, best scores, awards and settings are there the next time you play. This includes:

* The caves you have escaped, and so which levels and Endless are open to you
* Your best score and the most gems you have collected in each level, and your best score in Endless
* The awards you have won and when each was won
* Running totals of your play that awards are won by, such as the runs you have played, the wing beats you have made, the gems you have collected, the caves you have escaped on Hard and the kinds of power-up you have picked up
* Your sound volumes and your settings: the difficulty, *Sparkles and light* and *Relaxed speed*

This information is stored on your own device. It is not transmitted to us or to any third party, and we have no access to it. If your device backs up its apps' data (on Android, to your Google account), it may include this information in that backup, which is kept by your device's provider, not by us.

You can erase your progress, best scores and awards at any time using the RESET PROGRESS control on the app's settings screen. Your sound volumes and settings are kept until you change them. Uninstalling the app erases everything stored on your device.

## 3. Advertising

Bat Flap is supported by advertisements provided through Google AdMob.

The app shows a banner advertisement on its main menu. No banner is shown while you play or on the app's other screens.

The app also offers optional rewarded video advertisements. Awards earned during a run are collected by watching one to the end once the run is over. Watching a rewarded video is always your choice. If you decline, you simply don't get that reward: the awards from that run are not collected, but they can be earned again.

Depending on your location, device settings, and consent choices, advertisements may be personalized or non-personalized.

Google and its advertising partners may use device identifiers and other information to provide, measure, personalize, and improve advertising and to detect and prevent fraud.

For more information about how Google uses information from apps that use its services, please see Google's privacy information:

https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites

## 4. Internet Access

Bat Flap can be played without an internet connection. Advertisements and rewarded videos need one. While your device is offline, rewarded videos are unavailable, so awards earned in a run can't be collected.

The app does not check your connection separately. It only notices that it is offline when an advertisement cannot reach the internet. It does not look at which network you are connected to.

## 5. Consent and Privacy Choices

Where required by applicable law, users may be presented with a consent message that allows them to make choices regarding the use of their information for advertising purposes.

Where such a choice has been presented, it can be revisited at any time using the PRIVACY OPTIONS control on the app's settings screen.

Users may also be able to control advertising personalization and advertising identifiers through their device privacy settings.

## 6. Children's Privacy

Bat Flap is a general-audience game.

We do not knowingly collect personal information directly from children.

Advertising services used by the app may process information as described in this Privacy Policy. Where required, appropriate restrictions are applied to advertising and data processing.

Parents or guardians who have questions regarding their child's privacy may contact us using the email address provided below.

## 7. Data Security

We do not operate our own servers, and Bat Flap sends none of your play to us.

Information processed by third-party services such as Google AdMob is handled according to their respective privacy and security practices.

Information sent by the app to these services is encrypted in transit.

## 8. Third-Party Services

Bat Flap uses third-party services that may collect or process information according to their own privacy policies:

**Google AdMob**: advertising, including rewarded video advertising, advertising measurement, analytics related to advertising, and fraud prevention. Its consent message is provided by Google's User Messaging Platform.

